  (text "NOTAS:\n1. SN74HCT125 (DIP-14) - Quad Buffer 3-State\n2. Todas ~OE ligadas ao GND (saidas habilitadas)\n3. Canal 1: GPIO13 (3.3V) -> 1A -> 1Y -> 100R -> WS2812B DIN (5V)\n4. Canais 2-4 disponiveis para uso futuro\n5. Capacitor 100nF entre VCC (pino 14) e GND (pino 7)\n6. Capacitor 1000uF proximo da fita LED WS2812B\n7. Resistor 62-100 Ohm no pino DIN do WS2812B"
    (at 88.9 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "90423577-f4df-46ab-b814-d6f2999a389c")
  )  (text "J1 (ESP32):\nPin 1 = GPIO13\nPin 2 = 3.3V\nPin 3 = 5V\nPin 4 = GND"
